---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { withBase } from "../utils/withBase";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Inside My Classroom"
  description="A window into real teaching practice — curriculum design, learning routines, assessment, and day-to-day life in the classroom."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="shell two-column">
      <div class="stack">
        <span class="eyebrow">Inside My Classroom</span>
        <h1>How this actually works in a real classroom.</h1>
        <p>
          This section answers the question teachers ask most: <em>but what does it actually look like?</em>
          Real examples, real routines, and real reflections from day-to-day practice.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="panel stack">
        <span class="eyebrow">What you'll find here</span>
        <h3>Practical, not theoretical</h3>
        <ul class="list-clean">
          <li>Curriculum planning and alignment examples</li>
          <li>Assessment and reflection systems in action</li>
          <li>Daily routines and classroom structures</li>
          <li>Unit and lesson design, start to finish</li>
          <li>Events, experiences, and large-scale planning</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-soft">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="stack">
          <span class="eyebrow">Curriculum Design & Alignment</span>
          <h2>Building a curriculum that connects vertically and horizontally.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="classroom-grid">
        <div class="panel stack">
          <h3>Vertical Progression</h3>
          <p>How skills and concepts build deliberately across year levels — so students aren't starting from scratch each year.</p>
          <a class="card-cta" href={withBase("/resources#vertical-horizontal-alignment")}>See the alignment infographic →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="panel stack">
          <h3>Horizontal Alignment</h3>
          <p>How units across subjects connect at the same year level — building coherence without losing subject identity.</p>
          <a class="card-cta" href={withBase("/resources#vertical-horizontal-alignment")}>See the alignment infographic →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="panel stack">
          <h3>IB Curriculum Mapping</h3>
          <p>Practical examples of mapping IB frameworks to real units — keeping the documentation useful rather than decorative.</p>
          <a class="card-cta" href={withBase("/resources")}>Browse planning resources →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="stack">
          <span class="eyebrow">Making Learning Visible</span>
          <h2>When students can see their learning, they take ownership of it.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="classroom-grid">
        <div class="panel stack">
          <h3>Assessment in Practice</h3>
          <p>Assessment that informs teaching — not just grades. Examples of how formative and summative tasks work together.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="panel stack">
          <h3>Student Reflection</h3>
          <p>Simple, consistent reflection routines that help students understand what they've learned and where to go next.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="panel stack">
          <h3>Feedback That Works</h3>
          <p>Practical feedback strategies that students actually use — specific, timely, and connected to next steps.</p>
          <a class="card-cta" href={withBase("/resources#making-learning-visible")}>See the infographic →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-soft">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div class="stack">
          <span class="eyebrow">Daily Routines & Structures</span>
          <h2>The systems that make a classroom run smoothly.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="classroom-grid">
        <div class="panel stack">
          <h3>Lesson Openings</h3>
          <p>How a lesson starts shapes everything that follows. Intentional openings that settle students and signal what's coming.</p>
          <a class="card-cta" href={withBase("/resources#how-you-start-shapes-everything")}>See the G.R.E.E.T prompt card →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="panel stack">
          <h3>Reducing Teacher Talk</h3>
          <p>The L.E.S.S framework in practice — how to give clearer instructions, ask better questions, and create more thinking time.</p>
          <a class="card-cta" href={withBase("/resources#say-less-get-more")}>See the L.E.S.S prompt card →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="panel stack">
          <h3>Transitions & Flow</h3>
          <p>Smooth transitions that don't lose momentum — practical signals, routines, and structures that keep class flow consistent.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-soft">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="tech-intro">
        <div class="stack">
          <span class="eyebrow">Tech Integration in PE</span>
          <h2>Using technology to enhance movement and learning.</h2>
          <p>A student-facing app built for the gym — challenges, difficulty levels, video demos, score logging, and reflection. Runs on any device, no login required.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-intro-actions">
          <a class="button" href="/pe-challenges.html" target="_blank">Open the app →</a>
          <a class="button-secondary" href={withBase("/say-hello")}>Request a demo</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Main showcase -->
      <div class="app-showcase">

        <!-- iPad in the middle -->
        <div class="showcase-ipad">
          <div class="ipad-landscape">
            <div class="ipad-left-bar"><div class="ipad-camera-side"></div></div>
            <div class="ipad-screen-landscape">
              <div class="app-mockup">
                <div class="app-header">
                  <span class="app-trophy">🏆</span>
                  <span class="app-title">PE Challenges</span>
                </div>
                <p class="app-subtitle">Choose a category to get started</p>
                <div class="app-categories">
                  <div class="app-cat orange"><span class="app-cat-icon">🏀</span><strong>Sport Skills</strong><span>Measurable sport challenges</span></div>
                  <div class="app-cat blue"><span class="app-cat-icon">💪</span><strong>Fitness Challenges</strong><span>Strength &amp; endurance tests</span></div>
                  <div class="app-cat green"><span class="app-cat-icon">🎯</span><strong>Target Games</strong><span>Accuracy &amp; focus tasks</span></div>
                  <div class="app-cat purple"><span class="app-cat-icon">🤸</span><strong>Movement Circuits</strong><span>Station-based activities</span></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="ipad-right-bar"><div class="ipad-home-side"></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Detail cards below -->
        <div class="showcase-cards">

          <!-- Challenge folder card -->
          <div class="showcase-card">
            <div class="sc-header orange-bg">
              <span>🏀</span>
              <div>
                <p class="sc-label">BASKETBALL FREE THROW</p>
                <p class="sc-sub">Shoot from the free throw line</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="sc-body">
              <p class="sc-section-label">SOLO CHALLENGES</p>
              <div class="sc-level green-level"><span class="sc-dot green-dot"></span><strong>Easy ✅</strong><span class="sc-tag green-tag">Close Range</span><p>Great for building confidence</p></div>
              <div class="sc-level orange-level"><span class="sc-dot orange-dot"></span><strong>Medium ✅</strong><span class="sc-tag orange-tag">Free Throw Line</span><p>Complete Easy first to unlock</p></div>
              <div class="sc-level red-level"><span class="sc-dot red-dot"></span><strong>Hard ✅</strong><span class="sc-tag red-tag">3-Point Line</span><p>Complete Medium first to unlock</p></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Log result card -->
          <div class="showcase-card">
            <div class="sc-header purple-bg">
              <span>📝</span>
              <div>
                <p class="sc-label">LOG YOUR RESULT</p>
                <p class="sc-sub">Basketball Free Throw · Close Range</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="sc-body">
              <div class="sc-form-row">
                <div class="sc-field"><label>Your name</label><div class="sc-input">First name...</div></div>
                <div class="sc-field"><label>Homeroom class</label><div class="sc-input">e.g. 4B...</div></div>
              </div>
              <div class="sc-field"><label>Your score (baskets / 10 shots)</label><div class="sc-input sc-score">0 <span>baskets / 10 shots</span></div></div>
              <div class="sc-field"><label>How hard did you try? ⬇️</label><div class="sc-stars">★ ★ ★ ★ ★</div></div>
              <div class="sc-field"><label>Reflect — What did you adjust between shots?</label><div class="sc-textarea">Type your answer here...</div></div>
              <div class="sc-save-btn">✅ Save My Result</div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell two-column">
      <div class="quote-card stack">
        <span class="eyebrow">More coming soon</span>
        <h2>Unit design, events, and real lesson examples on the way.</h2>
        <p>
          This section grows alongside the resource library. Upcoming additions include full unit planning examples,
          Athletics Day organisation, and real lesson walkthroughs with reflections.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="panel stack">
        <span class="eyebrow">In the meantime</span>
        <h3>Start with the resources</h3>
        <p>The downloadable resources are the most practical starting point — prompt cards, infographics, and planning tools ready to use today.</p>
        <a class="button" href={withBase("/resources")} style="width: fit-content; margin-top: 0.5rem;">Browse resources</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .classroom-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .card-cta {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .card-cta:hover {
    color: var(--accent-deep);
  }

  em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--accent-deep);
  }

  /* ── Tech intro ── */
  .tech-intro {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .tech-intro-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  /* ── App showcase ── */
  .app-showcase {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .showcase-ipad {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .showcase-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .showcase-card {
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.10);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.07);
  }

  .sc-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.85rem 1.1rem;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
  }

  .orange-bg { background: #fff3ed; border-bottom: 1px solid #ffe0cc; }
  .purple-bg { background: #f0eeff; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd6ff; }

  .sc-label {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: #555;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: none;
    line-height: 1.3;
    font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
  }

  .sc-sub {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: #888;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: none;
    line-height: 1.3;
    font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
  }

  .sc-body {
    padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .sc-section-label {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: #999;
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem;
    max-width: none;
    font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
  }

  .sc-level {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 10px;
    border: 1.5px solid transparent;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .sc-level p { font-size: 0.75rem; color: #888; margin: 0; max-width: none; flex-basis: 100%; font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif; line-height: 1.3; }
  .sc-level strong { font-size: 0.88rem; font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif; color: #2c2c2c; }

  .green-level  { background: #f0fff4; border-color: #27ae60; }
  .orange-level { background: #fff8f0; border-color: #e67e22; }
  .red-level    { background: #fff0f0; border-color: #e74c3c; }

  .sc-dot { width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .green-dot  { background: #27ae60; }
  .orange-dot { background: #e67e22; }
  .red-dot    { background: #e74c3c; }

  .sc-tag {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 0.15rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
  }

  .green-tag  { background: #27ae60; color: #fff; }
  .orange-tag { background: #e67e22; color: #fff; }
  .red-tag    { background: #e74c3c; color: #fff; }

  .sc-form-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0.5rem; }
  .sc-field { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.25rem; }
  .sc-field label { font-size: 0.72rem; color: #888; font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif; }

  .sc-input {
    border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 0.45rem 0.65rem;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: #bbb;
    background: #fafafa;
    font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
  }

  .sc-score { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
  .sc-score span { font-size: 0.7rem; color: #bbb; }

  .sc-stars { color: #ddd; font-size: 1.1rem; letter-spacing: 2px; }

  .sc-textarea {
    border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.65rem;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: #bbb;
    background: #fafafa;
    min-height: 50px;
    font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
  }

  .sc-save-btn {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6c5ce7, #8e7cf0);
    color: #fff;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0.65rem;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
    font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
  }

  .tech-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    width: fit-content;
    background: var(--terra);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .tech-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  /* ── Landscape iPad ── */
  .ipad-landscape {
    display: flex;
    align-items: stretch;
    background: #1c1c1e;
    border-radius: 24px;
    box-shadow:
      0 0 0 1px #3a3a3a,
      0 32px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.4),
      inset 0 0 0 2px #2a2a2a;
    width: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ipad-left-bar {
    width: 18px;
    background: #1c1c1e;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ipad-camera-side {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #3a3a3a;
    border: 1px solid #444;
  }

  .ipad-screen-landscape {
    flex: 1;
    background: #f0f0f5;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 6px;
    margin: 10px 0;
  }

  .ipad-right-bar {
    width: 22px;
    background: #1c1c1e;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ipad-home-side {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px solid #3a3a3a;
    background: #252525;
  }

  /* ── App Mockup ── */
  .app-mockup {
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .app-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    background: #6c5ce7;
    margin: -1rem -1.25rem 0;
    padding: 0.65rem 1.25rem;
  }

  .app-trophy {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  .app-title {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: #fff;
    font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
  }

  .app-subtitle {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: #666;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0.25rem 0 0.1rem;
    max-width: none;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .app-categories {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .app-cat {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 0.5rem;
    border-radius: 10px;
    border: 2.5px solid transparent;
    background: #fff;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .app-cat.orange { border-color: #ff6b35; }
  .app-cat.blue   { border-color: #4a90d9; }
  .app-cat.green  { border-color: #27ae60; }
  .app-cat.purple { border-color: #9b59b6; }

  .app-cat-icon { font-size: 1.5rem; }

  .app-cat strong {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #2c2c2c;
    font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .app-cat span {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    color: #888;
    font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .classroom-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .showcase-cards {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .tech-intro {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .sc-form-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
